# Code ownership -> review routing. GitHub requests review from the owner automatically on any PR that
# touches a matching path. This is a small, single-maintainer library, so the default owner is the
# maintainer; the specific rules exist to make the SAFETY-CRITICAL and CONTRACT paths impossible to
# change without that being visible in the review — not to distribute ownership.

# Default owner for everything.
*                              @zgranowitz

